spec.txt in this directory is the specification's text as published at
https://spec.commonmark.org/0.31.2/spec.txt, unmodified (PROVENANCE.md has
its size and SHA-256).

What it is here: test data. tests/markdown_tests.cpp reads the
specification's examples from it and compares what stxlib::markdown reads
with the HTML each example states. It is compiled into nothing, installed
nowhere and shipped in no program. STXlib's own source, stxlib::markdown
included, is not adapted from this text and keeps STXlib's licence.
